# unPublish with the same version applies when its timestamp is newer; a late retry is a Duplicate.
@run = 1
@id = unpublish-{{run}}

### Publish v2
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "publish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": { "title": "Draft" } }
]

### unPublish v2, newer timestamp: applies
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "unPublish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:30:00Z", "payload": { "title": "Draft" } }
]

### User: 404, not Visible
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{readerUsername}} {{readerPassword}}

### Admin: isPublished false
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}

### Late retry of publish v2, older timestamp: SkippedDuplicate
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "publish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": { "title": "Draft" } }
]

### Admin: still isPublished false
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
